    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">In this additional window you can select the position of the new bookmark in a list of all functions and procedures of the active file in the IDE. Each list item represents a possible bookmark position and shows the line number, method type and method name. </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">If </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">deny double bookmarks</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> is activated in options, all list items that have already been assigned to a bookmark are shown in a different font style and color and cannot be selected. </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:center; margin-top:30px; margin-right:6px; margin-bottom:24px; margin-left:6px;"><image src="EditorBookmarks20Select.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="100.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"></image></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><anchor id="Details" styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;"></anchor><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-size:16pt;" translate="true"> &#160; </text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><table styleclass="Default" rowcount="1" colcount="2" style="width:100%; cell-padding:0px; cell-spacing:0px; background-color:#cfe7ff;">
      <tr style="vertical-align:middle">
        <td style="height:24px; background-color:#cfe7ff;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="margin-left:6px; page-break-inside:avoid; page-break-after:avoid;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-weight:bold;" translate="true">Details </text></para>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40px; height:24px; background-color:#cfe7ff;">
          <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:right; margin-top:3px; margin-right:6px;"><link displaytype="image" src="__Jump2Top.png" type="topiclink" href=""><title translate="true">Jump to top of page</title></link></para>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table></para>
    <list id="0" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">By repeatedly clicking on the lightning symbol, the selection list can be </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; text-decoration:underline;" translate="true">sorted</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> by the attributes </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">LineNumber</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">, </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">MethodType</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> and </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">MethodName</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">. The active sort mode is displayed in the 4th panel of the statusbar. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">In addition to sorting, the list can also be </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; text-decoration:underline;" translate="true">filtered</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">. The filtering process is activated by entering letters of the filter mask. Only characters that enable successful filtering can be entered. With </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Backspace</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> the filter is reduced character by character; with </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Delete</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> the filter is removed. The active filter mask is shown in the 3rd panel of the statusbar. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The position of the new bookmark is transferred by </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">double-clicking</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> or using the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Select button</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> or pressing </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Return</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">; after that the window closes automatically. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">If you hold down the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Ctrl key</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> while </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">double-clicking</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">, the position of the new bookmark is transferred too, but the window remains open! This way, you can record several bookmarks very quickly. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">With the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Cancel button</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> or pressing </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Escape</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> you may close the window without selecting a new bookmark. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">You can access help by pressing the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">F1 key</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> or by clicking on the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">F1 symbol</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> in the statusbar. </text></li>
    </list>
